{"title":"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) #14</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) #17</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Vanessa set a school record for the most points in a single basketball game when her team scored <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/f/5afbad0b221f0ef70186fe70b08e6fc1efdd8dfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$48$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> points. The other six players on her team averaged <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/b/87b8245e043508c7c928c89b42f9ce38f04d720d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> points each. How many points did Vanessa score to set her school record?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/8/5c8c0317d0a5883eb549a965aae59e76053170e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 21 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 25 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 32 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 17 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can subtract the number of points that the other six team members got from the total number of points that the team got.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of points that the other six team members got. We can now set up an equation using the average given in the problem:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/5/c95589e003de511dbfb45ddc6798d10e22641411.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n}{6} = 3.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"64\" height=\"34\" />\n</p><p>Multiplying both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to get rid of the fraction, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/f/cef3e478827b8acab4da588e57b303e1c869c3e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 3.5 \\times 6 = 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"134\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>We can now subtract this from the total number of points that the team got, to get how many points Vanessa scored:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/8/15882a4e6b049f02bd584c6c1b9578de5dfdf466.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$48 - 21 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"148\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009